+\subsection{Axiom reports}
+The proposed audit asks Lean to print the axioms of
+\begin{itemize}
+  \item \lean{contender\_14};
+  \item \lean{contender\_13\_lt\_contender\_14};
+  \item \lean{fortyTwo\_F13\_steps\_lt\_F14}; and
